{"text": "\\ Department of\nHUMAN SERVICES\n\nKim Reynolds, Governor \u2018Adam Gregg, Lt. Governor Kelly Garcia, Director\n\nDecember 30, 2019\n\nJerry Rea, PhD\n704 Orchard\nGlenwood, IA 51534\n\nDr. Rea,\n\nThis letter is to inform you that effective today, December 30, 2019, you are being discharged from\nemployment with the Department of Human Services. This action is being taken as a result of a\nmounting list of disregard for policies and procedures.\n\nConsistent with paragraph 21 of your lease agreement, you are hereby given notice of the need to\nvacate the premises no later than 30 days from today. During this time, you are not to be on the\ngrounds of the Glenwood Resource Center where individuals are served or administrative services\nare being delivered.\n\nPlease direct any benefit questions to Jodi Gruening at jgrueni@dhs state ia.us.\nAs the Department of Justice investigation is ongoing, it is our expectation that you will remain\n\ncooperative throughout the process. Please provide your contact information so we may reach\nyou as necessary.\n\nSincerely,\n\nce\n\nRichard Shults\nDivision Administrator\n\n1305 E. Walnut Street, Des Moines, IA 60319-0114",
